{"type":"message","id":"7662e6be","parentId":"6c94c64e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T18:57:47.885Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why `/status` command didn't get a response. Looking at the session history, there's no prior `/status` command from this user before this message - their first message was \"你好\" and I responded with an introduction. Then they sent \"给你发/status 命令怎么没反应\".\n\nIt seems like they may have sent `/status` in a different session or channel, not in this one. Or they expected the `/status` to trigger some automatic response but it didn't.\n\nThe `/status` command is a gateway-level command that would be handled by the OpenClaw gateway directly, not by the agent. In Feishu, slash commands like `/status` may not be forwarded to the agent at all - they might be processed by the gateway and returned to the user directly. If the user didn't see a response, it could be:\n1. The command was processed but the response didn't show up in Feishu\n2. The command wasn't recognized\n3. It was sent in a different session\n\nI should explain this to the user and provide the status information they're looking for (which I already have from `session_status`).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"抱歉让开发者困惑了！在飞书对话中，`/status` 这类斜杠命令是由 OpenClaw 网关直接处理的，不会经过我这个 agent。如果网关处理后没有在飞书里显示回复，可能是通道问题。\n\n不过没关系，我已经帮你查到了状态，这是当前的运行信息：\n\n---\n\n📊 **OpenClaw 状态**\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| 🦞 **版本** | 2026.5.19 |\n| ⏱️ **运行时间** | Gateway 13h 53m · System 199d 8h |\n| 🧠 **当前模型** | `nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro` |\n| 🔑 **API Key** | NVIDIA_API_KEY（环境变量） |\n| 🔄 **降级模型** | minimax-m2.7 → glm-4.7-flash → minimax-m2.7 |\n| 📚 **上下文** | 405 / 1,000,000 tokens（0%） |\n| 🧹 **压缩次数** | 0 |\n| 🪢 **队列** | steer（深度 0） |\n\n---\n\n一切正常运行中，有什么需要我帮你处理的？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total